# BathCraft PWA — environment template
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored.
#
# Nothing below is required for local development today: the app runs fully
# offline with a local auth + data provider. These become live in milestone M6
# when the teammate's Supabase (auth + database) is shared. Setting the Supabase
# vars will switch the auth/data seams (src/lib/auth, src/lib/db) over to it.

# --- Supabase (M6: shared with the landing page for SSO) ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Landing page handoff ---
# Public URL of the marketing site whose "Start Planning Free" CTA opens this app.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LANDING_URL=https://bathcraft-pi.vercel.app
